    <string name="notice_section_1">Helix runs locally on this device: sessions, Provider config, keys and records are stored only on this device, with no cloud sync.</string>
    <string name="notice_section_2">Model requests go only to the Provider endpoint you explicitly configure. The UI always shows the destination (origin) and data residence (on-device / LAN / public cloud) of each request (FR-LLM-009).</string>
    <string name="notice_section_3">Credential-shaped content (API keys, OAuth tokens, Cookies, passwords, private keys, etc.) is refused before sending; both safety profiles refuse to send it (ADR-0005).</string>
    <string name="notice_section_4">High-sensitivity data is confirmed per send; the Standard profile offers no permanent allow. The default safety profile after first install and data reset is Standard.</string>
